  "description": "Unified pure C# .NET 10 LLM command-line application (glacier). High-performance inference with Universal Architecture Matrix (Llama 3, Phi-4, DeepSeek, Mistral, Qwen), in-process LoRA fine-tuning (Glacier.Tune), GGUF adapter fusion, in-process SIMD GraphRAG (Glacier.Rag), PagedAttention continuous batching server (Glacier.Serve), autonomous agent runtime (Glacier.Agent), and HuggingFace GGUF model downloader.",
